%% Revoke a grant while Sam is connected and a run triggered by Sam is running.
%% Lock order from 03-data-model.md 6.3, flow from 04-sync-protocol.md section 8.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant O as Owner (console)
  box api node A
    participant AZA as authz
    participant RUA as runs
  end
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  box api node B
    participant TL as sync log tail
    participant HUB as gateway hub with permission cache
  end
  participant S as App Sam
  participant AD as Agent adapter
  participant W as worker

  O->>AZA: POST grants/{id}/revoke with reason, fresh step-up
  AZA->>AZA: authorize(Owner, grant.revoke, grant), step-up valid
  AZA->>DB: BEGIN, first lock and increment permission_version
  AZA->>DB: read the visible targets of Sam beforehand, set grants.revoked_at
  AZA->>AZA: before the commit: I1 for affected agents with personal, difference before and after
  AZA-)RUA: in-tx event AccessReduced (Sam loses channel Support)
  RUA->>DB: active run of Sam in the channel: event run.cancel_requested (access_revoked) to the agent
  AZA->>DB: event_seq: grant.changed, access.changed (audience Sam), pg_notify
  AZA->>DB: audit_seq: audit entry with hash chain, COMMIT
  AZA-->>O: 200
  DB--)TL: NOTIFY event_log
  TL->>HUB: events in seq order
  HUB->>HUB: on access.changed: permission cache of Sam to the new permission version
  HUB-->>S: dispatch access.changed (removed channel Support), immediately
  HUB->>HUB: end focus on Support, discard buffered events from Support
  S->>S: delete local contents of Support, close the view with a notice
  HUB-->>AD: dispatch run.cancel_requested (access_revoked)
  AD->>AD: stop the runtime
  AD->>RUA: run.finish cancelled
  alt adapter reports nothing within agent.cancel_grace
    W->>DB: job runs.cancel_timeout: run cancelled with reason cancel_timeout
  end
  Note over HUB,S: Later events from Support: authorize(Sam, message.read) yields not_found, no delivery
  Note over W: Push checks push.deliver before every send, Sam gets no push from Support
